import{_ as t,o as i,c as a,a2 as o}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const p=JSON.parse(`{"title":"Entry 564 | Time Ethics | Ethical Critique of the Predatory Faction's Time Manipulations","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 564 | Time Ethics | Ethical Critique of the Predatory Faction's Time Manipulations","no":564,"module":3,"tags":["Time Ethics","Predatory Faction","Ethical Critique","Lifespan Theft","Cycle Harvesting"],"related":["04-Anti-Predation Core Thesis","88-Cross-Plane Ethical Principle","82-Basic Principles of Temporal Retrocognition","89-Temporal-Paradox Prevention Mechanism"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0564_模块3-时间伦理-掠夺派时间操作的伦理批判.md","filePath":"en/0564_模块3-时间伦理-掠夺派时间操作的伦理批判.md"}`),n={name:"en/0564_模块3-时间伦理-掠夺派时间操作的伦理批判.md"};function s(r,e,l,h,c,u){return i(),a("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[o('<h1 id="entry-564-time-ethics-ethical-critique-of-the-predatory-faction-s-time-manipulations" tabindex="-1">Entry 564 | Time Ethics | Ethical Critique of the Predatory Faction&#39;s Time Manipulations <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-564-time-ethics-ethical-critique-of-the-predatory-faction-s-time-manipulations" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 564 | Time Ethics | Ethical Critique of the Predatory Faction&#39;s Time Manipulations&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 3 · Dual-Track Time Domain Civilizational-Experience System | Benchmark base: Documents 04, 88, 82, 89</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-stealing-others-time-to-be-fast-oneself-is-the-most-unjust-kind-of-predation" tabindex="-1">Introduction: stealing others&#39; time to be fast oneself is the most unjust kind of predation <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-stealing-others-time-to-be-fast-oneself-is-the-most-unjust-kind-of-predation" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: stealing others&#39; time to be fast oneself is the most unjust kind of predation&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Previous entries cover how Anchor Symbiotic Civilization regulates its own time operations; this one turns the gun outward, <strong>critiquing the predatory faction system&#39;s time manipulations</strong>. Because as long as the predatory faction still exists, time ethics cannot only say &quot;how we do it,&quot; but must make clear &quot;what they did wrong, why wrong, how far wrong.&quot; The predatory faction&#39;s abuse of time is the most concealed, most unjust of all predatory acts — because what it steals is not goods, but life&#39;s very length. This entry does this ethical accounting.</p><p>Six top-level axioms here become critique&#39;s yardstick: anti-predation axiom is critique&#39;s general outline; republican axiom of Myriad Races accuses it of trampling all beings&#39; time equality; collective ascension axiom reveals it runs counter to lifting all; causal self-discipline axiom accuses it of perturbing causality, cycle harvesting; law-first axiom points out its operations inevitably cause temporal paradox and self-collapse. The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-the-predatory-faction-s-four-typical-time-operations" tabindex="-1">I. The Predatory Faction&#39;s Four Typical Time Operations <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-the-predatory-faction-s-four-typical-time-operations" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. The Predatory Faction&#39;s Four Typical Time Operations&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Cross-plane archaeology归纳出 the predatory faction&#39;s abuse of time concentrates in four typical forms:</p><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Operation</th><th>Manifestation</th><th>Ethical Qualification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Lifespan Theft</td><td>Devour others&#39; life length to extend self</td><td>Direct predation of life-time</td></tr><tr><td>Causal Rewrite</td><td>The strong arbitrarily rewrite history, others&#39; fate</td><td>Deprivation of causal autonomy</td></tr><tr><td>Cycle Harvesting</td><td>Manipulate reincarnation, divert others&#39; souls and merit</td><td>Cross-life predation</td></tr><tr><td>Time Monopoly</td><td>Monopolize acceleration resources; all beings can only slowly endure</td><td>Time privilege</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Four operations point to the same thing: <strong>treating &quot;time&quot; as spoils that may be privately occupied, seized.</strong></p><h2 id="ii-why-lifespan-theft-is-the-most-unjust-predation" tabindex="-1">II. Why Lifespan Theft Is the Most Unjust Predation <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-why-lifespan-theft-is-the-most-unjust-predation" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Why Lifespan Theft Is the Most Unjust Predation&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The predatory faction&#39;s most common time operation is devouring others&#39; lifespan to extend self. Ethical critique points straight at its guilt:</p><ol><li><strong>Steals life itself</strong>: goods stolen may be re-earned; lifespan devoured, that life&#39;s possibilities vanish forever;</li><li><strong>Strong bullying weak</strong>: those able to steal lifespan must be the strong; victims have no power to resist, the most asymmetric predation;</li><li><strong>Breaks causality</strong>: a life that should have run naturally is forcibly cut off, its causal chain broken, polluting the overall time flow.</li></ol><p>By contrast, Anchor Symbiosis uses consciousness acceleration + flesh freezing to solve &quot;want to live long, do more,&quot; without touching others&#39; one bit of time — the two contrasted, superiority is self-evident.</p><h2 id="iii-cycle-harvesting-cross-life-predation" tabindex="-1">III. Cycle Harvesting: Cross-Life Predation <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-cycle-harvesting-cross-life-predation" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Cycle Harvesting: Cross-Life Predation&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The deepest evil among the predatory faction&#39;s time operations is <strong>cycle harvesting</strong>: the strong manipulate reincarnation mechanisms, treating all beings&#39; souls, merit, causality as recoverable private property. Ethical critique three questions:</p><ul><li>Reincarnation is all beings&#39; natural causal flow; who gave the strong the right to &quot;recycle&quot;?</li><li>The harvested cannot even autonomously choose their next life; talk of equal evolutionary qualification?</li><li>This operation turns life and death itself into the strong&#39;s breeding ground, predation&#39;s ultimate form.</li></ul><p>Precisely therefore, causal self-discipline axiom nails cycle harvesting as absolute forbidden zone — it is not &quot;not quite good,&quot; but the original sin civilization spurns.</p><h2 id="iv-time-monopoly-taking-all-beings-slow-endurance-as-privilege" tabindex="-1">IV. Time Monopoly: Taking All Beings&#39; Slow Endurance as Privilege <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-time-monopoly-taking-all-beings-slow-endurance-as-privilege" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Time Monopoly: Taking All Beings&#39; Slow Endurance as Privilege&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The last critique is time monopoly: in the predatory faction system, time acceleration, the most precious resource, is monopolized by a few strong; myriad beings can only burn out their lives in slow cultivation with no end in sight. This seemingly steals no one, but is actually a <strong>structural predation</strong> — it deprives all beings&#39; fair qualification to obtain time dividends. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s dual-track time domain&#39;s very existence is the answer to this monopoly: time dividends should be accessible to all.</p><h2 id="v-critique-is-not-hostility-but-early-warning" tabindex="-1">V. Critique Is Not Hostility, but Early Warning <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-critique-is-not-hostility-but-early-warning" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Critique Is Not Hostility, but Early Warning&quot;">​</a></h2><p>This critique does not treat predatory-faction beings as enemies to be exterminated. Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, for individuals and civilizations led astray, always retains Civilizational Correction Engineering&#39;s exit — as long as willing to turn to symbiosis, history may be returned as lesson not settled. Critique targets the structure of &quot;treating time as spoils,&quot; not the pitiful ones in that structure also pressed underneath. Drawing this clearly is important: opposing predation is not opposing the predator himself; receiving people out of the predation structure is critique&#39;s endpoint.</p><h2 id="vi-this-critique-s-real-life-landing" tabindex="-1">VI. This Critique&#39;s Real-Life Landing <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-this-critique-s-real-life-landing" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. This Critique&#39;s Real-Life Landing&quot;">​</a></h2><p>This critique is not to display historical evidence, but for every living being now: it must remind civilizations still shrouded by the notion &quot;the strong may seize others&#39; time&quot; — stolen lifespan must eventually be returned, rewritten causality must eventually crack, harvested cycles must eventually break in their own hands. Critique&#39;s final landing is giving every predated being a fair cognition: the time you lost was not deserved; that is a debt not to be repudiated; and you standing on the symbiosis side today is refusing to pass this debt to the next generation. Axiom 6 landing: all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; easygoing slackers have a floor; strivers and Youth Supremes may superimpose more; predation loses meaning because all inherently possess infinity.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: the other side of critique is proof — predatory-faction time operations inevitably lose on the total energy ledger, civilizational-level self-destruction</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: this entry is anti-predation axiom&#39;s total accounting in the time dimension; four operations each convicted</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang-Luo-style &quot;bounty time, protagonist alone enjoys&quot; is precisely the specimen of time monopoly; this entry openly convicts it</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: critique stands on the side of myriad beings whose lifespan was stolen, harvested, monopolized</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: critique conclusions convert to time-ethics prohibitions, written into the Symbiotic Constitution, announced cosmos-wide</li><li><strong>Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law</strong>: all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity — infinite origin inherent in all; predation naturally loses its meaning</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The ethical critique of the predatory faction&#39;s time manipulations ultimately lets a plain truth spread through the heavens: <strong>time is not spoils, and life&#39;s length is even less something anyone may seize and keep.</strong> Lifespan theft, causal rewrite, cycle harvesting, time monopoly — these four operations seem variously packaged, stripped to the bottom are one thing: the strong turn the weak&#39;s time into their own stepping stones. Anchor Symbiotic Civilization&#39;s attitude toward them leaves no ambiguity: never rerun in its own dual track, never recognize external predatory factions, and always ready to use Civilizational Correction Engineering to pull led-astray civilizations back on track. Because a civilization that treats time as spoils will ultimately be settled by time itself.</p><p>In the final analysis, the ethical critique of the predatory faction&#39;s time manipulations described in this document is no isolated case — its causality and energy-level traces are filed throughout in the Alaya Network, traceable and verifiable.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./04-反掠夺主义核心论纲.html">04-Anti-Predation Core Thesis</a> · <a href="./88-跨位面伦理准则.html">88-Cross-Plane Ethical Principle</a> · <a href="./82-时间回溯基本原则.html">82-Basic Principles of Temporal Retrocognition</a> · <a href="./89-时间悖论防控机制.html">89-Temporal-Paradox Prevention Mechanism</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',30)])])}const m=t(n,[["render",s]]);export{p as __pageData,m as default};
